  "description": "OEDRO drop running boards are perfectly compatible with the 2024-2026 Toyota Tacoma Double Cab (Crew Cab). Featuring a triple-tube design, they offer enhanced protection for the vehicle’s underside and sides, while also helping to prevent damage to the rocker or suspension from obstacles.\nFeatures\nCustom Fit for Toyota Tacoma: Designed with a two-level layout, these running boards offer enhanced convenience for vehicles with lift kits and oversized tires, making access easier and safer.\nTwo Stairs Steps Triple-Tube Protection: The innovative three-tube design provides superior protection for the bottom and sides of your vehicle, preventing damage from obstacles like rocks or debris while ensuring a smooth, obstruction-free ride.\nEasy Bolt-Fixed Installation: Welded brackets deliver extra strength without the need for cutting or drilling, making installation quick, hassle-free, and secure.\nBuilt to Last: Crafted with a unique powder coating, these running boards are highly resistant to rust and corrosion, ensuring durability in any weather condition.\nEnhanced Safety & Grip: Laser-cut, anti-skid tread steps provide excellent traction, ensuring a safe and secure step in all conditions.\n1-Year Warranty & Professional Installation is recommended.\nFitment\nCompatible with 2024-2026 Toyota Tacoma Double Cab/Crew Cab(4 Full Size Doors=1:1).",
